.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH NPROC 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
nproc \- Print the number of cores available to the current process.
If the OMP_NUM_THREADS or OMP_THREAD_LIMIT environment variables are set, then
they will determine the minimum and maximum returned value respectively.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBnproc\fR [OPTIONS]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Print the number of cores available to the current process.
If the OMP_NUM_THREADS or OMP_THREAD_LIMIT environment variables are set, then
they will determine the minimum and maximum returned value respectively.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
print the number of cores available to the system
.TP
\fB\-\-ignore\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 0]
ignore up to N cores
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
